`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
- The "two frame systems" defect (B1/B6) is a two-copy problem. Cowork's promotion copies only the session directory, so anything stored beside it, like `frames/`, silently stays behind.
- A green `status: ok` from `harvest_frames` can't say whether the viewer can display the frames. That is why I added a `warning` field rather than trusting the status alone.
